  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP - Regional Programme on Climate Security in Western Sahel (RPCS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is organized around four outcomes. Outcome 1 and 2 will be of regional scope, dealing with regional dimensions and processes, whereas outcomes 3 and 4 will focus more on community and local-level actions to reduce climate-related security risks.

Outcome 1: Effective decision making for early action through enhanced monitoring and information management over climate-related security risks 

Outcome 2: Integrated regional policy and collaboration across the climate &#x2013; security nexus

Outcome 3: Strengthened local governance systems for climate-related security risks and natural resources management

Outcome 4: Improved community resilience through sustainable and diversified livelihoods systems</narrative>
  </description>
